### Login para obter o token
# @name login
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Listar lançamentos
GET http://localhost:4000/api/getAllLancamentos HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar lançamento por ID
GET http://localhost:4000/api/getLancamentoByID/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Inserir lançamento
POST http://localhost:4000/api/insertLancamento HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "descricao": "Mensalidade cooperado",
  "valor": 250.00,
  "natureza": "entrada",
  "data": "2026-10-19",
  "contaId": 1,
  "status": "pendente"
}

### Atualizar lançamento
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/updateLancamento/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "descricao": "Mensalidade cooperado",
  "valor": 250.00,
  "natureza": "entrada",
  "data": "2026-10-19",
  "contaId": 1,
  "status": "pago"
}

### Remover lançamento (exclusão lógica)
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/deleteLancamento/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
